SUMMARY:BBDC–TPVG Pro Forma Business Services Exposure Review
DESCRIPTION:Collaborative review of the proposed pro forma Business Services industry exposure calculation using BBDC’s and TPVG’s latest Form 10-Q reports and investment fair values as of September 30\, 2025. Confirm that only industry categories explicitly referring to business services are included\, apply the assumption that Muon is the sole non-services provider within TPVG’s “Business Products and Services” category\, validate the combined fair-value denominator\, and review presentation of the resulting percentage to two decimal places. No analytical result is pre-stated in this meeting record.
LOCATION:Virtual meeting between BBDC and TPVG review teams
